Replace `<neighbor-ip>` with the actual IP address of your BGP neighbor. This enables rapid failover to a precomputed backup path for labeled IPv6 routes upon link failure. The `send 2` parameter advertises up to two paths per prefix, while `receive` accepts multiple paths from the neighbor.
