**Note:** This configuration assumes:
- Your neighbor is configured to accept multiple paths (RFC 7911 ADD-PATH or similar multipath support)
- EBGP peers are in the same subnet as the original next-hops
- Standard BGP path selection remains unaffected as these commands only control next-hop advertisement behavior

