```  
configure router bgp group <group-name>  
    path-mtu-discovery  
exit  
```  

3. **Enable for a specific neighbor**:  
```  
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>  
    path-mtu-discovery  
exit  
```  

This configuration sets the DF bit on packets, forcing routers along the path to send ICMP feedback if fragmentation is required. The MTU automatically adapts without manual intervention.
