2. Prevents acceptance of multiple route entries for the same group from neighbors (`receive none`)
3. Applies these settings globally to all BGP peers for multicast VPN IPv4 routes

The configuration should be applied in the global BGP context to affect all MVPN routing peers. You can also apply it to specific neighbor groups or individual peers if needed by navigating to:
- `config>router>bgp>group>add-paths` or
- `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>add-paths`
