  - `second-wait`: Base multiplier for subsequent failures (minutes).  
  - `max-wait`: Maximum hold time (minutes).  
- **`error-interval`**: Error-free period (minutes) required to reset the penalty counter.  

This configuration dampens session oscillations during peer instability while maintaining route advertisements for the specified durations.
