3. The `no shutdown` command explicitly activates the neighbor (by default, new neighbors are administratively disabled).  

This ensures the new neighbor inherits all existing group-level settings (e.g., address families, policies) without modifying current configurations. Verify the neighbor session with `show router bgp neighbor 192.0.2.45` after deployment.
