To ensure BGP uses SR-stitched paths from a less-preferred OSPF instance for next-hop resolution, configure the following:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        sr-ospf
                    exit
                exit
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter
                        sr-ospf3
                    exit
                exit
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter
                            sr-ospf
                        exit
                    exit
                    family ipv6
                        resolution-filter
                            sr-ospf3
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

