2. **`add-paths vpn-ipv4 send 8`**: Advertises up to 8 paths per VPNv4 prefix to the neighbor.
3. **`receive none`**: Blocks the router from accepting multiple paths per VPNv4 prefix from the neighbor, ensuring only one path per prefix is processed.

This configuration maintains your hub-and-spoke topology by controlling path advertisements and processing without disrupting existing flows.
